  {
    title: 'BSc Food Science / Food Technology (university route)',
    body: 'A separate, non-JEE track: direct university admission after 12th (usually PCB or PCM, university-dependent), offered widely by state and private universities and by ICAR-linked agricultural universities through the ICAR AIEEA UG exam. Shorter, cheaper, and more common than the BTech route, but generally weaker for engineering-cadre government and PSU eligibility later.',
