  'Government schemes — the Production Linked Incentive Scheme for Food Processing (PLISFPI), Mega Food Parks, PM Kisan Sampada Yojana, and PM Formalisation of Micro Food Processing Enterprises (PMFME) — have already generated a documented few lakh direct and indirect jobs and continue to add processing capacity and cold-chain infrastructure.',
